      "value": "What actually works as workaround (ugly...):\n\n```\n\nprivate void Start() {\n\n    SendCustomEventDelayedSeconds(nameof(_FOVDetection), 1f);\n\n}\n\n \n\npublic void _FOVDetection() {\n\n    Debug.Log($\"Start FOV (Delayed): {VRCCameraSettings.ScreenCamera.FieldOfView}\");\n\n}\n\n```\n\nReturns:\n\n`Start FOV (Delayed): 80`",
